?: You made it in, good. 
set voice_pitch = 0.7
???: Snuck in through the kitchen. 
set voice_pitch = 0.25
?: Lets go over the plan. 
set voice_pitch = 0.7
???: I think I got it, no need to-
set voice_pitch = 0.25
?: You ain't leavin' this here establishment 'less I'm [wave]certain[/wave] we're on the same page.
