???: Ahhh, you're such a stick in the mud. Fine.
???: We're gonna meet up at the rendezvouz point after the heat dies down.
???: Then we move the "payload" out to the docks. 
???: I got a guy that'll be waitin' there with the cash and a fishin' boat to move the goods.
set voice_pitch = 0.25
?: You sure that fella's straight? Folks who deal in stolen goods tend to be slippery.
set voice_pitch = 0.7
???: Slippery's good — slippery makes 'em easier to slide a coin to. Trust me, I ain't new to this racket.
set voice_pitch = 0.25
?: I hope so, for both of our sakes.
?: How do I get in if I get there before you?
set voice_pitch = 0.7
???: Nice try buddy. You think I'm gonna give you the code so you can sneak off without payin' me?
set voice_pitch = 0.25
?: I think if someone spots me idlin' around down there it could arouse suspicion that might get us arrested.
?: Besides, I can't move that thing alone. 
